OL,3,GNEWSABrewery closure 'nail in coffin'
OL,4,Afor 'beer capital'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Devastating," "completely and utterly
OL,7,Fdisgusting" and "a nail in the coffin".
OL,9,FPeople living in Burton-upon-Trent,
OL,10,FStaffordshire have not minced their
OL,11,Fwords in reaction to the news that
OL,12,FMarston's Brewery could close in 2027.
OL,14,FDescribed as the "beer capital of
OL,15,FEngland", Burton was once home to more
OL,16,Fthan 30 breweries and Marston's has had
OL,17,Flinks with the town for some 200 years.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
