OL,3,GNEWSABrewery closure 'nail in coffin'
OL,4,Afor 'beer capital'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 310 people are set to be
OL,7,Faffected by the proposals. The BBC has
OL,8,Fbeen in the area gathering a sense of
OL,9,Fwhat the announcement means for the
OL,10,Fpeople living and working there.
